  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Promote Digital Transformation and Social Inclusion in Mexico</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa para Promover la Transformacin Digital e Inclusin Social en Mxico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de este programa es aumentar el acceso de los ciudadanos a internet a travs de la transformacin e inclusin digital de Mxico, colaborando con el desarrollo social. Para lograrlo, se tienen los siguientes objetivos especficos: (i) promover la infraestructura de telecomunicaciones en redes crticas y de alto desempeo; (ii) promover la inclusin digital a travs del desarrollo de capacidades y habilidades digitales especialmente en zonas marginadas y remotas; y (iii) promover un fortalecimiento institucional que favorezcan la transformacin e inclusin digital.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of this program is to increase citizens&apos; access to the internet through the transformation and digital inclusion of Mexico, collaborating with social development. To achieve this, the following specific objectives are: (i) promoting telecommunications infrastructure in critical and high-performance networks; (ii) promote digital inclusion through the development of digital capacities and skills, especially in marginalized and remote areas; and (iii) promote institutional strengthening that favors digital transformation and inclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
